<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Left Click Spammer</Major>
    <Description>Spams clicks at a rapid pace, saving you from manually pressing the left click function rapidly. Great for spamming map functions ingame.

- Shotguns
- Prop Spawner
- Togglers
- Switch a slider setting that requires you to manually click once for the effect to happen

and much more. This feature can universally be used in other applications. 

To enable:
Right click the left button on the mouse figure, under macros, select "spammer".

Important:
It is highly recommended to bind a shortcut key to toggle this feature, This will cause numerous misclicks when hovering your cursor making it harder to navigate. </Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
